24
00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:10,750
Morisaki, nice save!

25
00:01:11,370 --> 00:01:14,170
The soccer ball is an important friend to me.

26
00:01:14,170 --> 00:01:15,800
I'll never abandon it!

27
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:17,890
Damn brat!

28
00:01:17,890 --> 00:01:20,720
He brought the goalkeeper back to his senses again.

29
