56
00:03:00,450 --> 00:03:04,700
Episode 15:
I Won't Lose
Because This Is My Dream

57
00:03:00,450 --> 00:03:04,700
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

58
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:02,950
At the National Youth Football Tournament...

59
00:03:02,950 --> 00:03:05,070
...the first group stage match of Group 1.

60
00:03:05,070 --> 00:03:10,540
The first half of the match between Nankatsu and Meiwa is about to end, with Meiwa leading 2-1.

61
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:13,500
Tsubasa-kun moves forward to attack.

62
00:03:13,500 --> 00:03:15,230
Let's go, Misaki-kun!

63
00:03:15,230 --> 00:03:16,290
Yes!

64
00:03:16,290 --> 00:03:20,130
Let's teach Kojiro that the ball is our friend!

65
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,970
What friend nonsense?!

66
00:03:21,970 --> 00:03:23,720
Don't leave that duo alone!

67
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:25,190
Stop them no matter what!

68
00:03:25,190 --> 00:03:26,180
Okay!

69
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:27,390
I won't allow it!

70
00:03:27,930 --> 00:03:28,760
Misaki-kun!

71
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:30,980
Tsubasa-kun!

72
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:33,960
Here they come. Nankatsu's golden duo!

73
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:36,960
Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun control the ball perfectly...

74
00:03:36,960 --> 00:03:39,610
...and cut through Meiwa's half as one!

75
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:41,190
Damn it!

76
00:03:41,190 --> 00:03:43,360
Let's score the goal, Misaki-kun!

77
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:44,070
Yes!

78
00:03:44,070 --> 00:03:45,660
I'll stop you!

79
00:03:46,170 --> 00:03:48,210
Did he read the pass's trajectory?

80
00:03:48,210 --> 00:03:49,870
Hyuga-kun moved to intercept!

81
00:03:49,870 --> 00:03:50,790
Got it!

82
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:54,330
What?!

83
00:03:54,330 --> 00:03:56,040
A curve!

84
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:58,600
Did he predict Hyuga-kun would intervene?!

85
00:03:58,600 --> 00:04:01,130
Is Misaki-kun assisting Tsubasa-kun?

86
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:03,880
I just need to block the shot!

87
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,100
Friend, you're up, Misaki-kun!

88
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:09,840
No, he's not shooting! Tsubasa-kun makes the final pass in front of the goal!

89
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:11,020
These guys...

90
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:13,560
Misaki-kun rushes towards the ball!

91
00:04:14,310 --> 00:04:16,060
Goal!

92
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:21,400
Nankatsu ties the score before the first half ends!

93
00:04:22,250 --> 00:04:24,500
Misaki-kun, nice shot!

94
00:04:24,500 --> 00:04:26,740
Nice pass, Tsubasa-kun!

95
00:04:28,070 --> 00:04:30,490
You're amazing, Misaki!

96
00:04:31,770 --> 00:04:33,500
The first half is ending.

97
00:04:33,500 --> 00:04:36,750
We'll continue from 2-2 in the second half.

98
00:04:36,750 --> 00:04:39,130
You're amazing, Nankatsu!

99
00:04:39,130 --> 00:04:41,500
Tsubasa! Misaki!

100
00:04:42,460 --> 00:04:43,420
You did it!

101
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:44,360
Yes.

102
00:04:54,820 --> 00:04:58,310
It's impossible to predict how this match will end.

103
00:04:58,310 --> 00:05:00,900
Well done.

104
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,610
Tsubasa, well done.

105
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:04,410
Thanks, Ishizaki-kun.

106
00:05:04,410 --> 00:05:06,150
Everyone, you all did a great job.

107
00:05:06,150 --> 00:05:08,020
Finishing the first half in a draw was important.

108
00:05:08,020 --> 00:05:09,110
Yes.

109
00:05:09,110 --> 00:05:11,330
Morisaki, will you be okay in the second half?

110
00:05:11,330 --> 00:05:15,720
Yes. Please leave it to me. I'll protect our goal!

111
00:05:15,720 --> 00:05:17,330
You focus on attacking without worry!

112
00:05:17,330 --> 00:05:18,580
Okay!

113
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:21,920
Alright! As soon as the second half starts, we'll pressure the match!

114
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:24,320
Keep attacking until the very end!

115
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:25,670
Yes!

116
00:05:25,670 --> 00:05:26,380
Damn it!

117
00:05:27,780 --> 00:05:30,230
Then it will be a goal show.

118
00:05:30,850 --> 00:05:34,180
You pass the ball to me, and I'll definitely convert it to a goal!

119
00:05:34,180 --> 00:05:36,810
Carry the ball in front of the goal even at the cost of your lives!

120
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:39,980
Our football cannot lose!

121
00:05:39,980 --> 00:05:40,730
Yes!

122
00:05:40,730 --> 00:05:46,550
That brat called Tsubasa really fired up Kojiro.

123
00:05:46,550 --> 00:05:47,780
That's it, Kojiro.

124
00:05:48,420 --> 00:05:50,610
Attack is the best defense.

125
00:05:50,610 --> 00:05:52,880
Overwhelm the enemy with your power.

126
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:53,780
Yes!

127
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:57,990
I didn't come here to lose!

128
00:05:57,990 --> 00:06:01,250
Especially to them!

129
00:06:02,350 --> 00:06:06,390
Everyone is doing their best to make up for the team's shortcomings.

130
00:06:06,390 --> 00:06:07,090
Yes.

131
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:10,710
Alright! Keep it up in the second half too!

132
00:06:10,710 --> 00:06:13,220
Tsubasa! Misaki! Morisaki!

133
00:06:13,960 --> 00:06:17,000
Genzo, you want to play too, don't you?

134
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:20,390
But you'll have to be patient for now, just a little patience.

135
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:23,010
The players are coming out onto the field.

136
00:06:23,010 --> 00:06:25,480
The second half is about to begin.

137
00:06:25,480 --> 00:06:27,490
Second half.

138
00:06:27,490 --> 00:06:29,860
The match will be decided in this half.

139
00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:31,240
Tsubasa-kun...

140
00:06:31,240 --> 00:06:32,990
Tsubasa and Hyuga...

141
00:06:32,990 --> 00:06:35,120
Misaki, don't you dare lose.

142
00:06:35,780 --> 00:06:37,620
This will be the final part of their battle.

143
00:06:37,620 --> 00:06:41,580
Is Tsubasa better, or Kojiro?

144
00:06:42,770 --> 00:06:46,380
I'll show you my true football...

145
00:06:46,380 --> 00:06:48,340
...Ozora Tsubasa!

146
00:06:49,590 --> 00:06:52,340
The second half begins.

147
00:06:52,810 --> 00:06:56,470
Look at that! The side that started fast is Nankatsu!

148
00:06:56,470 --> 00:07:01,300
After tying the score in the first half, the fired-up Misaki-kun gets the ball and...

149
00:07:01,300 --> 00:07:03,350
...dribbles forward skillfully.

150
00:07:03,350 --> 00:07:04,400
Don't allow it!

151
00:07:04,400 --> 00:07:05,270
Okay!

152
00:07:05,270 --> 00:07:07,070
Meiwa forms a sliding barrier!

153
00:07:07,940 --> 00:07:10,110
But the ball stays with Misaki-kun.

154
00:07:11,320 --> 00:07:13,070
Don't think you're something!

155
00:07:13,800 --> 00:07:16,370
Hyuga-kun slides and gets the ball!

156
00:07:16,370 --> 00:07:19,370
It was a heavy slide that could almost be considered a foul.

157
00:07:19,370 --> 00:07:22,750
With your way of playing football, you have no chance of winning against us!

158
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:27,920
You'll cry after seeing our true power in the second half!

159
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:29,210
I won't allow it!

160
00:07:29,210 --> 00:07:31,220
Nankatsu tries to get the ball!

161
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,890
This time the ball hits Izawa-kun!

162
00:07:35,890 --> 00:07:36,760
Izawa-kun!

163
00:07:37,370 --> 00:07:38,100
Takeshi!

164
00:07:38,570 --> 00:07:41,770
Hyuga-kun, who passed to Sawada-kun, starts running directly.

165
00:07:42,550 --> 00:07:43,350
Hyuga-san!

166
00:07:43,350 --> 00:07:45,480
A cross is coming!

167
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:47,690
I won't run away. I'll definitely save it.

168
00:07:48,650 --> 00:07:51,190
Take this!

169
00:07:51,190 --> 00:07:52,530
A powerful shot!

170
00:07:53,820 --> 00:07:55,860
Goal!

171
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:58,420
This time, instead of targeting the goalkeeper...

172
00:07:58,420 --> 00:08:00,660
...a shot that finds the goal.

173
00:08:00,660 --> 00:08:04,170
Meiwa takes the lead again, 3-2.

174
00:08:04,170 --> 00:08:05,340
Izawa-kun.

175
00:08:05,340 --> 00:08:07,570
Are you okay, Izawa?

176
00:08:07,570 --> 00:08:08,510
Yes.

177
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:11,250
Do you understand now, Nankatsu?!

178
00:08:12,090 --> 00:08:14,340
This is our football!

179
00:08:16,590 --> 00:08:19,600
It's not over yet! Everything can still turn around!

180
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:22,360
This time Nankatsu goes on the attack.

181
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,350
We won't lose!

182
00:08:25,700 --> 00:08:26,600
Kisugi!

183
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,360
Taki!

184
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:29,730
Alright!

185
00:08:29,730 --> 00:08:31,800
Nankatsu doesn't give up!

186
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,990
Their attacks are very synchronized!

187
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:36,490
Mark Tsubasa! Don't leave Tsubasa alone!

188
00:08:38,530 --> 00:08:40,240
Take it, Misaki!

189
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:42,750
The ball goes to playmaker Misaki-kun.

190
00:08:42,750 --> 00:08:46,600
However, the ace player Tsubasa-kun is terribly marked!

191
00:08:47,040 --> 00:08:47,630
What?!

192
00:08:48,310 --> 00:08:51,550
Tsubasa-kun escapes the marking with a quick feint!

193
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:52,550
What?!

194
00:08:53,260 --> 00:08:54,010
Tsubasa-kun!

195
00:08:57,680 --> 00:09:00,140
A header from Tsubasa-kun!

196
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:03,850
Nankatsu ties the score again!

197
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,560
Damn it!

198
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:10,820
It's turning into a very competitive match!

199
00:09:10,820 --> 00:09:14,090
Both teams, with all their effort...

200
00:09:14,090 --> 00:09:19,010
...try to deliver the ball to their forwards, Hyuga-kun and Tsubasa-kun, in front of the opponent's goal.

201
00:09:19,010 --> 00:09:21,780
And whenever the ball reaches them...

202
00:09:21,780 --> 00:09:24,670
...both convert it into a goal.

203
00:09:24,670 --> 00:09:27,680
It's impossible to predict the match's outcome!

204
00:09:29,790 --> 00:09:32,800
Nankatsu ties the score again!

205
00:09:36,090 --> 00:09:37,770
The score is 5-5.

206
00:09:37,770 --> 00:09:42,130
Under the scorching sun, Nankatsu, Meiwa, Tsubasa-kun, Hyuga-kun...

207
00:09:42,130 --> 00:09:43,900
...do not accept surrender!

208
00:09:43,900 --> 00:09:46,280
Only 5 minutes left until the match ends.

209
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:48,060
That bastard...

210
00:09:48,060 --> 00:09:51,170
Both teams are at the same level.

211
00:09:51,170 --> 00:09:55,280
In this terrible heat, willpower comes to the fore rather than technique.

212
00:09:55,280 --> 00:10:00,980
A battle between two players who have poured all their emotions...

213
00:10:00,980 --> 00:10:03,410
...into their own football styles.

214
00:10:03,410 --> 00:10:05,160
I'll never lose!

215
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:08,210
Will Nankatsu or Meiwa score the next goal?

216
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:13,790
Sawada-kun gets the ball and tears down the wing!

217
00:10:14,140 --> 00:10:14,840
Pass to me!

218
00:10:16,160 --> 00:10:17,240
Hyuga-san!

219
00:10:17,240 --> 00:10:18,920
Sawada-kun sends a cross!

220
00:10:18,920 --> 00:10:20,180
A high ball!

221
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:25,510
No matter what, I cannot lose!

222
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:29,810
I cannot lose, damn it!

223
00:10:30,560 --> 00:10:32,060
Aerial duel!

224
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:37,440
Goal!

225
00:10:38,490 --> 00:10:42,450
In the 16th minute of the second half, Meiwa takes the lead once again.

226
00:10:42,450 --> 00:10:45,740
Can we say Hyuga-kun won with his larger physique?

227
00:10:45,740 --> 00:10:46,910
See?!

228
00:10:46,910 --> 00:10:50,960
My football is different from your child's play!

229
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,420
Ours is not a game!

230
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:53,810
What?!

231
00:10:53,810 --> 00:10:57,330
Football... Football is my dream!

232
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:05,020
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

233
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:10,730
Only a short time, like 4 minutes, remains until the final whistle.

234
00:11:10,730 --> 00:11:12,430
Can Nankatsu get the equalizer?

235
00:11:12,430 --> 00:11:14,770
Everyone, we'll definitely tie the score!

236
00:11:14,770 --> 00:11:18,070
We'll definitely protect the goal we scored!

237
00:11:18,070 --> 00:11:21,430
Ozora Tsubasa... What kind of dream is that?

238
00:11:21,430 --> 00:11:23,990
Football is not a child's game.

239
00:11:23,990 --> 00:11:26,370
I'll teach you that!

240
00:11:26,770 --> 00:11:27,870
The match continues.

241
00:11:27,870 --> 00:11:31,290
Nankatsu moves forward with all its players.

242
00:11:31,290 --> 00:11:33,130
Push, Nankatsu!

243
00:11:33,130 --> 00:11:35,290
Get the equalizer!

244
00:11:35,290 --> 00:11:37,170
I believe in you, Tsubasa!

245
00:11:37,170 --> 00:11:41,920
Nankatsu tries to deliver the ball to their ace, Tsubasa-kun.

246
00:11:41,920 --> 00:11:46,970
However, Tsubasa-kun in front of the goal is being marked by Hyuga-kun!

247
00:11:46,970 --> 00:11:51,620
Tsubasa! I'll intercept every pass that comes to you!

248
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:54,640
Damn Hyuga!

249
00:11:54,640 --> 00:11:56,360
Watch out, Urabe!

250
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,110
Nankatsu lost the ball.

251
00:11:59,110 --> 00:12:00,490
Attack!

252
00:12:00,490 --> 00:12:02,570
If you got the ball, all you have to do is attack!

253
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:04,070
Yes!

254
00:12:04,070 --> 00:12:09,580
Is the secret of Meiwa's strength that they not only defend but also attack until the end?

255
00:12:09,580 --> 00:12:11,220
Exactly.

256
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:13,880
If your team is only good at defense...

257
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:16,040
...it means you haven't developed a good team.

258
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:19,340
Fall back! If they score another goal, we're done for!

259
00:12:22,160 --> 00:12:24,010
Sawada-kun sends the ball inside.

260
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:24,840
Damn it!

261
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:27,580
Mine! Finishing shot!

262
00:12:28,300 --> 00:12:32,220
Morisaki-kun jumps and makes a wonderful save!

263
00:12:32,220 --> 00:12:32,930
What?!

264
00:12:32,930 --> 00:12:34,490
Nice, Morisaki!

265
00:12:34,490 --> 00:12:35,560
We're safe.

266
00:12:35,560 --> 00:12:39,110
Nankatsu won't lose!

267
00:12:39,110 --> 00:12:41,820
Morisaki-kun's pass goes to Misaki-kun.

268
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:42,780
I won't allow it!

269
00:12:43,990 --> 00:12:45,570
He sends it forward with a single touch.

270
00:12:45,570 --> 00:12:48,490
Only Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun are there.

271
00:12:48,490 --> 00:12:49,390
Kojiro!

272
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,910
Get the ball, Tsubasa-kun!

273
00:12:50,910 --> 00:12:52,290
I'll definitely get it!

274
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:53,160
I won't lose!

275
00:12:53,160 --> 00:12:55,460
The final confrontation of the match!

276
00:12:56,650 --> 00:12:58,000
An aerial duel again!

277
00:12:58,000 --> 00:13:00,090
This time both are equal!

278
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:04,010
Neither can win and they fall to the ground!

279
00:13:04,010 --> 00:13:05,260
Tsubasa-kun!

280
00:13:05,900 --> 00:13:08,300
Tsubasa-kun gets up right away and starts running!

281
00:13:08,300 --> 00:13:10,140
You did it, Tsubasa-kun!

282
00:13:10,140 --> 00:13:14,390
Tsubasa-kun, quickly taking the loose ball, starts running towards Meiwa's goal.

283
00:13:15,210 --> 00:13:15,980
Damn it!

284
00:13:15,980 --> 00:13:19,440
Hyuga-kun also gets up immediately and starts chasing after him!

285
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,510
Will Hyuga-kun be able to catch up?

286
00:13:21,510 --> 00:13:23,370
The final battle!

287
00:13:23,370 --> 00:13:27,280
I have to tie the score to keep my promise to Wakabayashi-kun!

288
00:13:27,280 --> 00:13:29,970
What's this about football being your dream?!

289
00:13:29,970 --> 00:13:32,290
In football, there is only winning and losing!

290
00:13:32,290 --> 00:13:33,810
That's all there is!

291
00:13:34,090 --> 00:13:39,380
I'll show you that you're wrong with this tackle, Ozora Tsubasa!

292
00:13:41,740 --> 00:13:44,960
He escapes Hyuga-kun's sliding tackle!

293
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,840
What?!

294
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:49,080
And from there, he fires a volley!

295
00:13:49,950 --> 00:13:51,350
Goal!

296
00:13:51,990 --> 00:13:56,270
Nankatsu ties the score again at the very end of the match!

297
00:13:58,330 --> 00:14:02,410
Even though I tried to tackle with all my might, he got away.

298
00:14:03,620 --> 00:14:05,210
Nonsense.

299
00:14:05,730 --> 00:14:09,530
It's impossible for me to lose.

300
00:14:13,240 --> 00:14:15,750
Football is my dream!

301
00:14:17,250 --> 00:14:18,520
You did it! You did it!

302
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,560
That was amazing!

303
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:21,130
You did it, Tsubasa-kun!

304
00:14:21,130 --> 00:14:21,780
Yes.

305
00:14:21,780 --> 00:14:23,250
That's our Tsubasa.

306
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:27,180
You may have lost once in the aerial duel and in the tackle.

307
00:14:27,180 --> 00:14:29,260
But you won't lose a second time.

308
00:14:29,260 --> 00:14:31,900
That's the strength of Tsubasa.

309
00:14:31,900 --> 00:14:34,860
Alright, everyone. Only one minute left.

310
00:14:34,860 --> 00:14:37,470
We've come this far! We'll definitely win!

311
00:14:37,470 --> 00:14:38,770
Yes!

312
00:14:39,390 --> 00:14:40,930
Hyuga-san.

313
00:14:40,930 --> 00:14:45,400
Takeshi, when the match starts, give me a slow pass.

314
00:14:49,190 --> 00:14:53,330
Ozora Tsubasa, you're talented.

315
00:14:53,330 --> 00:14:55,720
In the national tournament...

316
00:14:55,720 --> 00:15:00,160
...I never thought there'd be someone who could engage in a one-on-one battle with me.

317
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:02,170
But everything will end here.

318
00:15:02,170 --> 00:15:04,750
With this shot... With this single shot...

319
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:06,170
This--

320
00:15:07,290 --> 00:15:10,840
I'll make everything up to now meaningless!

321
00:15:12,510 --> 00:15:13,300
Oh no!

322
00:15:13,300 --> 00:15:18,390
It's a long shot aimed directly at the goal!

323
00:15:19,170 --> 00:15:20,430
Not working! He can't reach it!

324
00:15:24,010 --> 00:15:26,940
No! It's not going in! It hit the goal post!

325
00:15:28,620 --> 00:15:30,300
Nankatsu clears it!

326
00:15:30,300 --> 00:15:33,610
No! Hyuga-kun intercepts the ball!

327
00:15:33,610 --> 00:15:36,080
He doesn't give up until the very last moment!

328
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:38,520
You're incredible, Hyuga Kojiro.

329
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:40,850
To have such passion for winning...

330
00:15:40,850 --> 00:15:42,420
Even more than Wakabayashi-kun.

331
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:43,960
He's in shooting range.

332
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:46,340
But we've already entered extra time.

333
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:52,550
What? Tsubasa stood in the way of the shot.

334
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:55,550
This time Tsubasa-kun is marking Hyuga-kun.

335
00:15:55,550 --> 00:16:01,560
Hyuga-kun tries to get past, but Tsubasa-kun, trying to protect the goal, doesn't allow it.

336
00:16:02,090 --> 00:16:05,310
I'll never lose either! I'll never allow it!

337
00:16:05,310 --> 00:16:08,570
I'll be the winner! I will!

338
00:16:08,570 --> 00:16:10,530
Keep it up, Tsubasa!

339
00:16:10,530 --> 00:16:11,690
Hyuga-san!

340
00:16:11,690 --> 00:16:13,150
Tsubasa!

341
00:16:13,910 --> 00:16:17,160
The stadium is falling apart with screams!

342
00:16:17,160 --> 00:16:23,660
The match that began with the confrontation between Tsubasa-kun and Hyuga-kun...

343
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:28,540
...continued between the two, and now it will end between the two!

344
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:31,050
Don't lose, Tsubasa!

345
00:16:31,050 --> 00:16:32,880
Stick with it to the end, Kojiro!

346
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:35,800
Stick with it to the end and fire your shot!

347
00:16:37,430 --> 00:16:41,850
Tsubasa-kun's foot slips and he loses his balance!

348
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,650
Here's the chance!

349
00:16:43,650 --> 00:16:48,020
Hyuga-kun gets past Tsubasa-kun and gets into shooting position!

350
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:48,770
Now!

351
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:53,030
Hyuga-kun can't shoot! Tsubasa-kun clears the ball!

352
00:16:53,030 --> 00:16:53,900
I did it!

353
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:56,530
He acted like that on purpose!

354
00:16:56,530 --> 00:16:57,870
Tsubasa!

355
00:16:58,630 --> 00:17:00,620
The ball goes to Takasugi-kun.

356
00:17:00,620 --> 00:17:01,790
The final whistle--

357
00:17:17,840 --> 00:17:20,050
G-Goal!

358
00:17:21,600 --> 00:17:25,080
And the referee blows the whistle.

359
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:27,100
Nankatsu loses!

360
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:35,340
What an ending!

361
00:17:35,340 --> 00:17:37,820
Both teams were striving to win...

362
00:17:37,820 --> 00:17:42,700
...and in the battle between the aces...

363
00:17:42,700 --> 00:17:46,120
...it was Sawada-kun who caught Nankatsu off guard amid the chaos!

364
00:17:46,120 --> 00:17:52,550
7-6! Meiwa wins the first match in Group 1 against Nankatsu!

365
00:17:53,490 --> 00:17:55,920
Meiwa won the match, but...

366
00:17:55,920 --> 00:17:59,550
...the battle between Tsubasa and Hyuga ended in a draw.

367
00:18:02,090 --> 00:18:03,560
Tsubasa.

368
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:09,060
Damn it...

369
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:13,070
Is he... crying?

370
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:15,250
Let's go, Tsubasa.

371
00:18:16,170 --> 00:18:16,980
Yes.

372
00:18:19,070 --> 00:18:22,470
Good match, Nankatsu, Meiwa!

373
00:18:22,470 --> 00:18:24,080
Good game!

374
00:18:25,380 --> 00:18:29,810
The spectators give great cheers for both teams leaving the field.

375
00:18:29,810 --> 00:18:34,460
The eleven of Nankatsu and Meiwa fought well.

