00:18:41,420 --> 00:18:43,580
Why is everyone's face down?

377
00:18:43,920 --> 00:18:46,560
We may have lost, but it was a good match.

378
00:18:46,560 --> 00:18:48,980
Don't get down right away.

379
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:52,560
We haven't been eliminated from the tournament yet.

380
00:18:52,560 --> 00:18:53,540
What?

381
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:55,140
That's right.

382
00:18:55,140 --> 00:18:59,610
Two teams from each group will advance to the qualifiers.

383
00:18:59,610 --> 00:19:03,760
If we win the remaining matches, we'll have a chance to advance!

384
00:19:03,760 --> 00:19:05,080
That's right.

385
00:19:05,080 --> 00:19:06,120
Exactly.

386
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:11,250
Tsubasa! A captain must never lose morale!

387
00:19:11,250 --> 00:19:16,550
Forget today's defeat and focus on winning every match from now on!

388
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:21,080
Then we can face Meiwa again in the finals.

389
00:19:22,300 --> 00:19:23,640
Yes.

390
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,000
Let's look at the next match!

391
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:27,600
Let's win them all!

392
00:19:30,380 --> 00:19:31,520
I'm Shiroyama.

393
00:19:33,480 --> 00:19:35,740
Morisaki, there's a phone call.

394
00:19:35,740 --> 00:19:36,980
