395
00:19:37,770 --> 00:19:41,170
You lost, but it was a good match.

396
00:19:41,170 --> 00:19:43,990
Well done.

397
00:19:43,990 --> 00:19:46,580
Wakabayashi-san!

398
00:19:46,580 --> 00:19:49,570
Until I return, Nankatsu's goal is entrusted to you.

399
00:19:49,570 --> 00:19:51,670
Yes. I'll do my best.

400
00:19:51,670 --> 00:19:54,340
By the way, is Tsubasa okay?

401
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:57,040
What? I'll hand it to him right away.

402
00:19:57,610 --> 00:19:59,260
Is that you, Tsubasa?

403
00:19:59,820 --> 00:20:01,260
Yes.

404
00:20:01,710 --> 00:20:02,710
Yes.

405
00:20:03,310 --> 00:20:04,760
Yes.

406
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:06,280
Everything is fine.

407
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:11,520
We'll win all the next four matches and advance to the qualifiers.

408
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:14,560
Exactly. You can trust us, Wakabayashi-san.

409
00:20:14,560 --> 00:20:18,020
We'll definitely win! Right, everyone?

410
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:20,020
Yes!

411
00:20:20,650 --> 00:20:22,970
I'm counting on you, kids.

412
00:20:22,970 --> 00:20:28,530
I'll come to you as soon as my leg heals.

